Note (added by SyLC, not part of the upstream repo): the FFmpeg/nv-codec-headers
repository (https://github.com/FFmpeg/nv-codec-headers) ships no standalone
LICENSE file at its root (verified via the GitHub Contents API on 2026-07-24;
root contains only .gitignore, Makefile, README, ffnvcodec.pc.in, include/).
The license is instead the copyright/permission notice embedded verbatim at
the top of every vendored header, reproduced below unmodified (comment
markers stripped) for visibility alongside the header. It is a standard
MIT-style grant.

